This project is a derivative of phiera, a Python Hiera parser by Andrei
Zbikowski and Rob King:

    https://github.com/Nike-Inc/phiera
    https://pypi.org/project/phiera/

phiera is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of that
license is included at LICENSES/phiera-Apache-2.0.txt.

The files derived from phiera are:

    src/hyera/core.py                (from phiera/phiera.py)
    src/hyera/_hiera_config.py       (from phiera/phiera.py)
    src/hyera/_location_resolver.py  (from phiera/phiera.py)
    src/hyera/_interpolation.py      (from phiera/phiera.py)

Each was modified by jose-pr and carries a notice saying so.

